{"uuid": "9b8ddb55-81c4-4cac-87d0-20baf43ef692", "status": true, "parsed": {"nodes": [{"id": "H1", "content": "A is styrene (C8H8), which has a molecular weight of approximately 104 and a degree of unsaturation of 5, so statement 1 is correct", "type": "MECHANISM_STEP", "ability_tags": ["1.1 Molecular Geometry & Symmetry Analysis", "2.4 Product Structure Prediction"]}, {"id": "H2", "content": "The reaction involves a retro-[3+2] cycloaddition where the reactant decomposes into styrene and B, implying B is a 1,3-dipole, so statement 2 is correct", "type": "MECHANISM_STEP", "ability_tags": ["2.2 Reaction Pathway & Intermediate Identification", "2.3 Reaction Mechanism & Kinetic Interpretation"]}, {"id": "H3", "content": "C (formed from B) has a charge-separated structure where the positive and negative formal charges are on different types of atoms (e.g., C/N or N/O), so statement 3 is correct", "type": "MECHANISM_STEP", "ability_tags": ["1.6 Bonding Pattern & Electronic Effect Analysis", "2.4 Product Structure Prediction"]}, {"id": "H4", "content": "D releases N2 gas, which is the most common gas in the atmosphere, so statement 4 is incorrect", "type": "MECHANISM_STEP", "ability_tags": ["2.4 Product Structure Prediction", "4.2 Interpretation & Inference of Experimental Phenomena"]}, {"id": "H5", "content": "E is a carbene intermediate generated from D, and the carbene carbon atom does not satisfy the octet rule, so statement 5 is incorrect", "type": "MECHANISM_STEP", "ability_tags": ["1.5 Application of Chemical Bonding Theories", "2.2 Reaction Pathway & Intermediate Identification"]}, {"id": "H6", "content": "The correct statements are 1, 2, and 3, therefore Option B is correct", "type": "OPTION_JUDGMENT", "ability_tags": ["2.4 Product Structure Prediction", "2.2 Reaction Pathway & Intermediate Identification", "1.5 Application of Chemical Bonding Theories"]}], "edges": [{"from": "H1", "to": "H2"}, {"from": "H2", "to": "H3"}, {"from": "H3", "to": "H4"}, {"from": "H4", "to": "H5"}, {"from": "H5", "to": "H6"}, {"from": "H1", "to": "H6"}, {"from": "H2", "to": "H6"}, {"from": "H3", "to": "H6"}, {"from": "H4", "to": "H6"}], "matches": [{"h_id": "H1", "r_id": "R1"}, {"h_id": "H2", "r_id": "R2"}, {"h_id": "H3", "r_id": "R3"}, {"h_id": "H4", "r_id": "R4"}, {"h_id": "H5", "r_id": "R5"}, {"h_id": "H6", "r_id": "R6"}]}}
